PART B — DATASET IMAGES  (Research-Use / Attribution)
====================================================================
Applies to: the 40 image files under `dataset/images/` (the LG-CISH codebook).

These images are DERIVED (resized/curated) from third-party benchmark suites — UCID,
the Kodak Lossless True Color Image Suite, and USC-SIPI — which the LG-CISH authors
do NOT own. They are redistributed here ONLY to make the paper reproducible, under
the following terms:

  1. Permitted use: non-commercial academic research, teaching, and reproduction of
     the results in the accompanying paper.
  2. Attribution: you must credit the LG-CISH codebook dataset (see CITATION.cff and
     dataset/README.md) AND the original sources (UCID, Kodak, USC-SIPI).
  3. Source terms prevail: your use must also comply with the licenses and terms of
     the original UCID, Kodak, and USC-SIPI datasets. Where those terms are more
     restrictive than this notice, the original terms govern.
  4. No warranty: the images are provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, and
     the LG-CISH authors accept no liability arising from their use.

If you are the rights holder of any source image and object to its inclusion, please
open an issue on the repository and it will be removed.
